            "text": "{\"type\":\"standard\",\"title\":\"2026 Men's T20 World Cup final\",\"displaytitle\":\"<span class=\\\"mw-page-title-main\\\">2026 Men&#039;s T20 World Cup final</span>\",\"namespace\":{\"id\":0,\"text\":\"\"},\"wikibase_item\":\"Q138573045\",\"titles\":{\"canonical\":\"2026_Men's_T20_World_Cup_final\",\"normalized\":\"2026 Men's T20 World Cup final\",\"display\":\"<span class=\\\"mw-page-title-main\\\">2026 Men&#039;s T20 World Cup final</span>\"},\"pageid\":78416043,\"thumbnail\":{\"source\":\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/c3/2026_T20_World_Cup_Final_Programme_Cover_by_ICC.jpeg/250px-2026_T20_World_Cup_Final_Programme_Cover_by_ICC.jpeg\",\"width\":330,\"height\":413},\"originalimage\":{\"source\":\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/c/c3/2026_T20_World_Cup_Final_Programme_Cover_by_ICC.jpeg/250px-2026_T20_World_Cup_Final_Programme_Cover_by_ICC.jpeg\",\"width\":282,\"height\":353},\"lang\":\"en\",\"dir\":\"ltr\",\"revision\":\"1343423527\",\"tid\":\"2b61807c-1f6a-11f1-a694-4ddc5df6cc65\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-14T05:53:48Z\",\"description\":\"International cricket match\",\"description_source\":\"local\",\"content_urls\":{\"desktop\":{\"page\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Men's_T20_World_Cup_final\",\"revisions\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Men's_T20_World_Cup_final?action=history\",\"edit\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Men's_T20_World_Cup_final?action=edit\",\"talk\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_Men's_T20_World_Cup_final\"},\"mobile\":{\"page\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Men's_T20_World_Cup_final\",\"revisions\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_Men's_T20_World_Cup_final\",\"edit\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Men's_T20_World_Cup_final?action=edit\",\"talk\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_Men's_T20_World_Cup_final\"}},\"extract\":\"The 2026 ICC Men's T20 World Cup final was a Twenty20 International (T20I) cricket match played at the Narendra Modi Stadium in Ahmedabad, India, on 8 March 2026 to determine the winner of the 2026 ICC Men's T20 World Cup. It was played between the defending champions India and New Zealand.\",\"extract_html\":\"<p>The <b>2026 ICC Men's T20 World Cup final</b> was a Twenty20 International (T20I) cricket match played at the Narendra Modi Stadium in Ahmedabad, India, on 8 March 2026 to determine the winner of the 2026 ICC Men's T20 World Cup. It was played between the defending champions India and New Zealand.</p>\"}"
