            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"type\":\"standard\",\"title\":\"2026 Kenya floods\",\"displaytitle\":\"<span class=\\\"mw-page-title-main\\\">2026 Kenya floods</span>\",\"namespace\":{\"id\":0,\"text\":\"\"},\"wikibase_item\":\"Q138637932\",\"titles\":{\"canonical\":\"2026_Kenya_floods\",\"normalized\":\"2026 Kenya floods\",\"display\":\"<span class=\\\"mw-page-title-main\\\">2026 Kenya floods</span>\"},\"pageid\":82610225,\"lang\":\"en\",\"dir\":\"ltr\",\"revision\":\"1343393605\",\"tid\":\"c4c86c4a-1f41-11f1-82aa-df95e1d8f3f7\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-14T01:04:36Z\",\"description\":\"Natural disaster in Kenya\",\"description_source\":\"local\",\"content_urls\":{\"desktop\":{\"page\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Kenya_floods\",\"revisions\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Kenya_floods?action=history\",\"edit\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Kenya_floods?action=edit\",\"talk\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_Kenya_floods\"},\"mobile\":{\"page\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Kenya_floods\",\"revisions\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_Kenya_floods\",\"edit\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_Kenya_floods?action=edit\",\"talk\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_Kenya_floods\"}},\"extract\":\"In early March 2026, flash flooding caused by heavy rainfall affected parts of Kenya, particularly the capital Nairobi, killing at least 62 people. Floodwaters inundated roads across the city after intense overnight rainfall caused rivers to overflow, sweeping away vehicles and stranding motorists. The victims died mainly from drowning or electrocution.\",\"extract_html\":\"<p>In early March 2026, flash flooding caused by heavy rainfall affected parts of Kenya, particularly the capital Nairobi, killing at least 62 people. Floodwaters inundated roads across the city after intense overnight rainfall caused rivers to overflow, sweeping away vehicles and stranding motorists. The victims died mainly from drowning or electrocution.</p>\"}"
