            "text": "{\"type\":\"standard\",\"title\":\"Assassination of Ali Khamenei\",\"displaytitle\":\"<span class=\\\"mw-page-title-main\\\">Assassination of Ali Khamenei</span>\",\"namespace\":{\"id\":0,\"text\":\"\"},\"wikibase_item\":\"Q138507700\",\"titles\":{\"canonical\":\"Assassination_of_Ali_Khamenei\",\"normalized\":\"Assassination of Ali Khamenei\",\"display\":\"<span class=\\\"mw-page-title-main\\\">Assassination of Ali Khamenei</span>\"},\"pageid\":82537558,\"thumbnail\":{\"source\":\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Ali_Khamenei_2026.02.12_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Ali_Khamenei_2026.02.12_%28cropped%29.jpg\",\"width\":330,\"height\":440},\"originalimage\":{\"source\":\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/09/Ali_Khamenei_2026.02.12_%28cropped%29.jpg/960px-Ali_Khamenei_2026.02.12_%28cropped%29.jpg\",\"width\":999,\"height\":1332},\"lang\":\"en\",\"dir\":\"ltr\",\"revision\":\"1343480174\",\"tid\":\"b37272cd-1fc0-11f1-9bd6-6ad494ebcac2\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-03-14T16:13:13Z\",\"description\":\"2026 assassination in Tehran, Iran\",\"description_source\":\"local\",\"coordinates\":{\"lat\":35.6919,\"lon\":51.3986},\"content_urls\":{\"desktop\":{\"page\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Ali_Khamenei\",\"revisions\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Ali_Khamenei?action=history\",\"edit\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Ali_Khamenei?action=edit\",\"talk\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Assassination_of_Ali_Khamenei\"},\"mobile\":{\"page\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Ali_Khamenei\",\"revisions\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Assassination_of_Ali_Khamenei\",\"edit\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Ali_Khamenei?action=edit\",\"talk\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Assassination_of_Ali_Khamenei\"}},\"extract\":\"On 28 February 2026, Ali Khamenei, the supreme leader of Iran, was assassinated in Tehran as part of a series of Israeli airstrikes aimed at high-ranking Iranian officials. Khamenei's death was confirmed by the Iranian government on 1 March. His death occurred as part of a wider joint operation by the United States and Israel, using strategic locations intelligence from the US's Central Intelligence Agency to determine the whereabouts of several leaders. Satellite imagery suggested that Khamenei's residence in the city was severely damaged during the attack.\",\"extract_html\":\"<p>On 28 February 2026, Ali Khamenei, the supreme leader of Iran, was assassinated in Tehran as part of a series of Israeli airstrikes aimed at high-ranking Iranian officials. Khamenei's death was confirmed by the Iranian government on 1 March. His death occurred as part of a wider joint operation by the United States and Israel, using strategic locations intelligence from the US's Central Intelligence Agency to determine the whereabouts of several leaders. Satellite imagery suggested that Khamenei's residence in the city was severely damaged during the attack.</p>\"}"
